This dataset represents the world's major hydrological basins and respective sub-basins according to its hydrological characteristics. Source: WWF [HydroSHEDS](https://www.hydrosheds.org/) and Hydro1K

More information on data source at https://data.apps.fao.org/catalog//iso/7707086d-af3c-41cc-8aa5-323d8609b2d1

Attribute table schema, field description:

- MAJ_BAS - major basin code; 

- MAJ_NAME - major basin name;

- MAJ_AREA - major basin area (square km); 

- SUB_BAS - sub-basin code; 

- SUB_NAME - sub-basin name; 

- SUB_AREA -  sub-basin area (square km); 

- TO_BAS -  downstream sub-basin code (towards which water flows) (-888 internal sub-basins and -999 draining to the sea)

